; CHECK-NEXT:    --> {(8 + %x)<nuw>,+,8}<nuw><%loop> U: [8,0) S: [8,0) Exits: (8 + (8 * ((1016 + (-1 * %x)) /u 8))<nuw> + %x) LoopDispositions: { %loop: Computable }
